id: primordial-majin
name: Primordial Majin
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Trait and never enforced (the user's).
requirement: Majin
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: You are not a Minion
description: >
  Majins are not made of the same flesh and bone as most races. Their flexible body can be best described as a humanoid pile of goop with a texture similar to chewing gum. This uniqueness, however, affords them the ability to instantly repair their body as well as separate portions of their body to be used for a variety of abilities.
